<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on HK financial basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on HK financial basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Monday it has launched 1.8 billion</p>
<p>American-style call warrants on a basket of six financial</p>
<p>stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc		 0.012 shares</p>
<p> Hang Seng Bank Ltd		0.014 shares</p>
<p> Bank of East Asia Ltd	   0.02  shares</p>
<p> Guoco Group Ltd		   0.006 shares</p>
<p> Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd	 0.007 shares</p>
<p> FPB Bank Holding Co Ltd	 0.027 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$5.47	PREMIUM	24 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.07	GEARING	7.14x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.JAN.98    EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	25.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$4.97	LISTING DATE 26.FEB.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
